WEBVTT

00:00:29.475 --> 00:00:35.105
ikh shtel aykh yetst for mayn familye. dos iz mayn froy, Khaye

00:00:35.533 --> 00:00:38.146
un dos iz MEINE ALTERER SOHN, GIL

00:00:38.146 --> 00:00:40.744
un dos iz der tsveyter SOHN, TAL

00:00:40.744 --> 00:00:42.935
un mayn tokhter, LIAT.

00:02:04.093 --> 00:02:07.633
DASS IST DAS BILD VON MEIN GOTTSELIGEN VATER

00:02:07.633 --> 00:02:13.452
DAS eyntsike bild vos ikh hob fun mayne eltern. fun mayn mame hob ikh nisht keyn bilder

00:02:15.771 --> 00:02:17.672
un dos bild iz

00:02:18.471 --> 00:02:21.553
f- efsher far di khasene nokh fun mayn tate.

00:02:21.610 --> 00:02:23.342
dos veys ikh nisht genoy.

00:02:26.773 --> 00:02:28.420
vu iz links

00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:30.154
vi di KAMERA

00:02:30.154 --> 00:02:32.167
di zayt oder di zayt?

00:02:32.747 --> 00:02:34.124
DASS iz links?

00:02:37.438 --> 00:02:43.544
DASS iz a bild fun mayn GOTTSELIGEN bruder vos ikh hob im gelozt NACH di krig bay UNK

00:02:43.544 --> 00:02:45.448
familye rabiner

00:02:46.213 --> 00:02:47.574
Portugal.

00:02:47.597 --> 00:02:50.341
DA links iz mayn KLEINER BRUDER.

00:02:51.968 --> 00:02:55.691
UND NACH SIEBZEHN JAHRE hob ikh im nokh a MAHL gezen.

00:02:56.912 --> 00:02:57.913
un dos

00:02:57.913 --> 00:02:59.791
tsayg ikh ⟨IM⟩ ZWEITEN bild.

00:03:07.577 --> 00:03:09.607
DASS iz di bilder

00:03:09.607 --> 00:03:11.824
fun ale dray brider.

00:03:12.488 --> 00:03:20.970
gants links iz mayn elterer bruder. in der MITTE iz mayn GOTTSELIGER bruder vos ikh hob frier gets- gesh- gezen a bild

00:03:21.111 --> 00:03:25.982
ven er WAR kleyn. nokh SIEBZEHN JAHRE hob ikh im dos ershte mol gezen

00:03:26.089 --> 00:03:28.361
un gants rekhts bin ikh.

00:03:28.772 --> 00:03:33.069
dos WAR in di fuftsiker JAHRE. mayn elterer bruder heyst NATAN

00:03:33.244 --> 00:03:36.362
un er hot geheysn Hershele Tsvi

00:03:36.362 --> 00:03:39.279
un ikh bin der JOSEF, GANZ RECHT.

00:03:45.900 --> 00:03:47.618
dos muz zayn in

00:03:48.415 --> 00:03:53.572
dos iz nokh a bild fun mayn bruder vos ikh hob BEKOMMEN fun bakante.

00:03:53.713 --> 00:03:57.554
der tsveyter fun links iz mayn bruder.

00:03:58.101 --> 00:04:00.440
un dos hob ikh bakumen in di

00:04:01.847 --> 00:04:04.861
dos bild iz gemakht gevorn varshayndlekh

00:04:05.627 --> 00:04:06.481
in

00:04:06.623 --> 00:04:08.861
ACHTUNDVIERZIG, NEUNUNDVIERZIG

00:04:09.373 --> 00:04:11.459
BEVOR ikh hob im gezen

00:04:11.820 --> 00:04:14.255
iz hot, hob ikh bakumen a bild

00:04:14.255 --> 00:04:15.071
fun

00:04:15.668 --> 00:04:17.791
bakante, hot men mir aza bild

00:04:17.791 --> 00:04:18.834
gegebn.

00:04:21.168 --> 00:04:24.183
dos iz der eyntsiker ZEICHEN vos ikh hob fun im.

00:04:34.720 --> 00:04:37.847
DASS iz a ALTES bild funem

00:04:37.847 --> 00:04:39.962
lager in ZYPERN.

00:04:41.250 --> 00:04:46.610
links iz mayn elterer bruder NATAN, un RECHTS BIN ICH. DASS WAR

00:04:47.005 --> 00:04:48.369
in ZYPERN.
